{
 "rc": {
  "i18n": {
   "zh-CN": {
    "title": "今日打卡",
    "days": "天",
    "addItem": "点开添加事项",
    "empty": "添加第一件要坚持的事",
    "masked": "已隐藏",
    "moreA": "还有 ",
    "moreB": " 件 · 点开看全部"
   },
   "en-US": {
    "title": "Today's check-ins",
    "days": "d",
    "addItem": "Tap to add a habit",
    "empty": "Add the first habit to keep",
    "masked": "Hidden",
    "moreA": "",
    "moreB": " more · tap to see all"
   }
  },
  "cells": [
   {
    "id": "bg",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "0pt",
    "y": "0pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}",
    "h": "{parent.h}",
    "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EEF7F3)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161B1D\\,#182221)@90"
   },
   {
    "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):5pt 圆点 / 卡名左侧 / 间距 9pt / 每张卡恰好一次。⚠️ 色值恒 #2E9E6B|#45C793,**不跟事项的调色板走** —— 这颗点答的是「这是 checkin 的卡」,不是「这件事是紫色的」;跟着 pal 变会让同一个包在盘上看着像六个源。",
    "id": "dot",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "{name.y}+({name.h}-5pt)/2",
    "w": "5pt",
    "h": "5pt",
    "bgColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "2.5pt",
     "leftB": "2.5pt",
     "rightT": "2.5pt",
     "rightB": "2.5pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "name",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "23pt",
    "y": "12pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-37pt-88pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${@i18n.title}",
    "fontSize": "13pt",
    "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "typeface": "System-Bold"
   },
   {
    "_note": "卡名行最右那一格恒有内容(card-design-system §3 + §5):常态渲 MM-DD 日期锚(零网络包,锚答的是「这一屏说的是哪天」);打码态改渲状态标记 —— 打码 ≠ 空态,空态是 `--`/空槽加事实陈述,打码是主动语态的一句状态,而那一刻这张卡上没有任何随时间变的可见量、锚零信息量。⚠️ 与网格下方那对坐标轴刻度**刻意重复右端那个日期**:轴读作刻度、右上角读作时间戳,两者在读者那里不是同一件事,而少了右上角这一格,这张卡在一屏 20 张卡里就是唯一空着右上角的那张。",
    "id": "mk",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-94pt",
    "y": "15pt",
    "w": "80pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "alignmentH": "2",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "text": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),${@i18n.masked},findNotEmpty::(${dateLbl},--))]",
    "fontSize": "9pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
   },
   {
    "id": "sub",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "34pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${doneCnt},0)]/$[findNotEmpty::(${allCnt},0)]",
    "fontSize": "11pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "_note": "日期已挪到右上角那一格(§3),这里只留今天的完成数 —— 同一张卡上不放两个日期。"
   },
   {
    "_note": "6 行固定槽位(2026-10-08 改):有事项 = 列表底板;一件事都没有(新用户 / 取不到)= 第 1 行无底只写提示、下面 5 行画幽灵底板保住版式;已有事项时后面的空槽隐形,第一个空槽只写一行素文提示(infosource-standard §4.4a:入口不给按钮外观)。",
    "id": "r0",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "58pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
    "h": "44pt",
    "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(${h0},1),#E7E9EE|#20232A,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${allCnt},0),0),#00000000|#00000000,#00000000|#00000000))]",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "12pt",
     "leftB": "12pt",
     "rightT": "12pt",
     "rightB": "12pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "op",
    "action": "if",
    "props": {
     "val": "$[if::(eq::(${h0},1),1,0)]"
    },
    "react": [
     {
      "type": "op",
      "action": "if",
      "props": {
       "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${i0},_),_),0,1)]"
      },
      "react": [
       {
        "id": "ri0",
        "type": "img",
        "x": "{r0.x}+10pt",
        "y": "{r0.y}+15pt",
        "w": "14pt",
        "h": "14pt",
        "url": "@[file://xWidget/assets/ic/${i0}.$[if::(eq::(${theme},dark),d,l)].uri]"
       },
       {
        "id": "rn0",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{ri0.r}+6pt",
        "y": "{r0.y}",
        "w": "{r0.w}-124pt",
        "h": "44pt",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),••••,findNotEmpty::(${n0},--))]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "alignmentV": "1"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "op",
      "action": "if",
      "props": {
       "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${i0},_),_),1,0)]"
      },
      "react": [
       {
        "id": "rm0",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{r0.x}+10pt",
        "y": "{r0.y}",
        "w": "{r0.w}-108pt",
        "h": "44pt",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),••••,findNotEmpty::(${n0},--))]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "alignmentV": "1"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "rs0",
      "type": "txt",
      "x": "{r0.r}-94pt",
      "y": "{r0.y}",
      "w": "52pt",
      "h": "44pt",
      "text": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),••,findNotEmpty::(${t0},0))] ${@i18n.days}",
      "fontSize": "11pt",
      "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
      "maxLines": "1",
      "alignmentV": "1",
      "alignmentH": "2"
     },
     {
      "id": "rd0",
      "type": "layer",
      "x": "{r0.r}-34pt",
      "y": "{r0.y}+10pt",
      "w": "24pt",
      "h": "24pt",
      "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),#D3D7DE|#33353B,if::(eq::(${d0},1),${m0},#D3D7DE|#3A3D45))]",
      "cornerRadius": {
       "leftT": "12pt",
       "leftB": "12pt",
       "rightT": "12pt",
       "rightB": "12pt"
      },
      "events": {
       "onClick": "numable://self/page/quick?id=${w0}"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "op",
      "action": "if",
      "props": {
       "val": "$[if::(eq::(${d0},1),1,0)]"
      },
      "react": [
       {
        "id": "rk0",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{rd0.x}",
        "y": "{rd0.y}",
        "w": "24pt",
        "h": "24pt",
        "text": "✓",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#0E1A14",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "alignmentH": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "op",
      "action": "if",
      "props": {
       "val": "$[if::(eq::(${d0},0),if::(gt::(${v0},0),1,0),0)]"
      },
      "react": [
       {
        "id": "rc0",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{rd0.x}",
        "y": "{rd0.y}",
        "w": "24pt",
        "h": "24pt",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${v0},0)]/$[findNotEmpty::(${g0},1)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "1",
        "alignmentV": "1"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "op",
    "action": "if",
    "props": {
     "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${h0},0),1),0,1)]"
    },
    "react": [
     {
      "id": "rp0",
